From: gargrohin <29701609+gargrohin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 07:31:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] Add action_policy_robotwin_nano experiment, run TOML and
 launcher

The experiment copies action_policy_libero_nano (model, optimizer, action-head
skip-on-load, LR multipliers) and swaps in the RoboTwin dataset (domain
robotwin, id 17, untrained in the public base). Defaults are sized for one
node of H100-80GB: FSDP over all ranks, 32 samples per rank, 8 dataloader
workers. The launcher derives grad_accum_iter from GLOBAL_BATCH (default 2048,
the LIBERO recipe), the per-rank batch and the number of CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
